From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] msado15: Command and Parameter properties, Parameters collection (2014)

msado15: Command and Parameter properties, Parameters collection (2014)

Command CommandTimeout, Prepared, Name, State, Dialect, NamedParameters and
ActiveConnection (a Connection or a connection string); Parameters Item by
position or name, Delete (which only ever removed the first parameter),
_NewEnum and Refresh; Parameter Precision, NumericScale, Attributes and
AppendChunk.
